Package: vcf
Version: 0.3.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: brawlnic <brawlnic@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Description: Forge HMAC-SHA256 session tokens (VaultCore lab / CTF)
 CLI tool: 'vcf'. Forges signed session cookies in the
 base64url(payload).base64url(hmac) format and optionally
 performs a GET with the forged cookie.
